steps:
Add this site to the Caddyfile, with that hash in place of HASH, then reload Caddy. It answers on port 2020 and refuses everything but those three reads.
:2020 {
basic_auth {
dumbmonit HASH
}
@readonly {
method GET
path /config/apps/http/servers /reverse_proxy/upstreams /metrics
}
handle @readonly {
reverse_proxy localhost:2019 {
header_up Host localhost:2019
}
}
respond 403
}
